        "kaoyan": "考研英语一 2016 Text 4"
      },
      "word": "Generate",
      "example": "\n...essentially try to generate additional revenue. (2016 T4)",
      "contextualMeaning": " | 2016 Text 4 语境：generate revenue 是商业高频搭配，'创造收入'。"
