          "title": "用法边界",
          "lines": [
            "典型搭配: temporary solution；temporary worker；temporary shelter。",
            "近义词区别: short-term 强调期限短；provisional 强调暂行、待确认；temporary 强调非永久。",
            "常见误用: temporary 不等于 unimportant。temporary measures 可能非常关键，只是时间上不是永久的。"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "深层解释",
          "lines": [
