            "这个词常用于公司、政府、比赛、广播和活动。announce the results、announce a policy、announce one's retirement 都意味着听众需要知道这个变化。"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "一语道破",
          "lines": [
            "\"To announce is to move information from private knowledge into public hearing. Announce 的核心，是把消息从内部带到公共视野。\""
