        {
          "title": "用法边界",
          "lines": [
            "典型搭配: *consider doing something*；*consider someone a friend*；*take something into consideration*。",
            "近义词区别: think about 最普通；consider 更认真、更有权衡感。regard as 更偏“视为”，而 *consider* 可兼有思考和视为。",
            "常见误用: *consider doing* 后接动名词，不接不定式：说 *consider moving*，不要说 *consider to move*。"
