          "title": "用法边界",
          "lines": [
            "典型搭配: *deprive someone of rights*；*sleep-deprived*；*deprive children of education*。",
            "近义词区别: take away 最普通；deprive 更正式，强调失去的是必要、应有或有价值的东西。rob someone of something 更有强烈损害感。",
            "常见误用: 固定结构是 *deprive someone of something*，不是 *deprive something from someone*。"
