        {
          "title": "用法边界",
          "lines": [
            "典型搭配: *nominate a candidate*, *be nominated for an Oscar*, *nomination committee*。",
            "近义词区别: appoint 是任命上任；nominate 只是提名，未必最终当选或获奖。",
            "常见误用: *nominate someone for an award*，不是 *nominate someone to an award*。"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "深层解释",
          "lines": [
