            "核心意象: 值得 + 注意 = noteworthy。"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "用法边界",
          "lines": [
            "典型搭配: it is noteworthy that；a noteworthy trend；noteworthy point",
            "近义词区别: noteworthy 强调值得留意；remarkable 强调引人注目；significant 强调重要。",
            "常见误用: noteworthy 作表语用 be noteworthy (that)；不可说 very much noteworthy（用 highly）。"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "深层解释",
          "lines": [
