          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "用法边界",
          "lines": [
            "典型搭配: *parallel lines*、*a parallel between two cases*、*parallel processing*。",
            "近义词区别: similar 只说相似；comparable 强调可比较；parallel 更强调两套结构、过程或路径并列对应。",
