      },
      "word": "Upset",
      "example": "\n...your most loyal customers really upset with you. (2016 T4)",
      "contextualMeaning": " | 2016 Text 4 语境：upset 在此为形容词'沮丧的、不满的'，be upset with sb. = 对某人不满。"
