            "核心意象: 平刃工具 + 切入土壤 + 翻挖 = spade。"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "用法边界",
          "lines": [
            "典型搭配: a garden spade、dig with a spade、the ace of spades、call a spade a spade。",
