            "与 protect 相比，preserve 更像长期维护。防虫网可以 protect plants；种子库可以 preserve genetic diversity。前者挡伤害，后者保延续。"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "一语道破",
          "lines": [
            "\"To preserve is to guard something against time as well as damage. Preserve 是同时对抗损坏和时间流失。\""
