        {
          "title": "用法边界",
          "lines": [
            "典型搭配: sensitive to sound、temperature-sensitive、sensitive skin、sensitive information。",
            "近义词区别: sensitive 强调易感知或易受影响；sensible 是明智的；responsive 强调有反应；vulnerable 强调容易受伤害。",
            "常见误用: sensitive 和 sensible 很容易混。a sensitive animal 是敏感，a sensible decision 是明智。"
