            "所以它很适合学术语境: a reader comprehends a passage, a student comprehends a principle, a researcher comprehends the implications. 如果只是明白一句简单指令，用 understand 更自然；如果对象复杂、需要整合，comprehend 更准确。"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "一语道破",
          "lines": [
            "\"To comprehend is to hold the whole pattern in your mind. Comprehend 不是知道一点，而是把整体抓住。\""
          ]
        }
