            "在论证里，example 和 evidence 的关系要分清。A single example can illustrate a point, but it may not prove a broad claim. 所以写作时常用 for example 来解释，用 evidence/data 来证明。"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "一语道破",
          "lines": [
