            "它比 field 更有“这块归谁/规则适用到哪里”的感觉。读学术或技术文本时，domain often tells you where a method works and where it does not."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "一语道破",
          "lines": [
            "\"A domain is a field with a boundary and a rule. Domain 是有边界、有规则的领域。\""
          ]
        }
      ],
