            "展开解析：I am writing to inform you of my decision to resign from my position as an editor at Designs & Fashions."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "词源与构词",
          "lines": [
            "词源/构词: 来自 edit + -or。edit 源于 Latin edere “出版、发布、拿出来”，e- “out” + dare “give”。",
            "原始画面: 一个人把原始稿件整理到可以公开交出去的状态。",
