        },
        {
          "title": "用法边界",
          "lines": [
            "典型搭配: play the piano/play piano, grand piano, piano lesson, piano concerto。",
            "近义词区别: piano 是原声钢琴；keyboard 可指电子键盘或键盘乐器总称；synthesizer 更强调电子合成音色。",
            "常见误用: 英语里“学钢琴”常说 learn piano 或 take piano lessons，不自然说 *study the piano subject*。"
