          "title": "用法边界",
          "lines": [
            "典型搭配: vertical stripes; striped shirt; zebra stripes。",
            "近义词区别: stripe 是条纹；line 更泛；pattern 是图案总称。",
            "常见误用: striped 是“有条纹的”，striped shirt 比 stripe shirt 更自然。"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "深层解释",
          "lines": [
