            "展开解析：Interest 作 noun，可指兴趣、利益、权益，也可指借钱或存钱产生的利息。例句：The loan carries an annual interest rate of 6%. 这里 interest 是资金使用的价格，不是兴趣。",
            "**考研英语一 2011 Text 1 补充**：Gilbert's own interest in new music has been widely noted: Alex Ross, a classical-music critic, has described him as a man who is capable of turning the Philharmonic into \"a markedly different, more vibrant organization.\" But what will be the nature of that difference?"
