        {
          "title": "用法边界",
          "lines": [
            "典型搭配: contemplate the future, contemplate a decision, sit and contemplate。",
            "近义词区别: contemplate 更深、更慢；consider 是考虑，较中性；gaze 是凝视，不一定思考决策。",
            "常见误用: contemplate 后可接动名词：contemplate moving abroad，不要写成 contemplate to move abroad。"
