            "它和 celebrate 的差别非常实用：We celebrated her promotion 是我们庆祝这件事；We congratulated her on her promotion 是我们向她道喜。前者是活动，后者是表达。",
            "congratulate yourself 还有“自我庆幸/自我表扬”的意味，有时带讽刺：Don't congratulate yourself too soon. 表示别太早觉得自己成功了。"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "一语道破",
          "lines": [
            "\"To congratulate is to share joy with the person who owns the good news. Congratulate 是把喜悦送到那个有喜事的人面前。\""
