          "title": "用法边界",
          "lines": [
            "典型搭配: food allergy；pollen allergy；allergic reaction；allergy symptoms；be allergic to peanuts。",
            "近义词区别: allergy 是免疫过敏；intolerance 是不耐受，不一定涉及免疫系统；sensitivity 更宽泛，可能只是敏感。",
            "常见误用: “我不喜欢牛奶”不是 I am allergic to milk，除非确有过敏反应；可说 I don't like milk 或 I am lactose intolerant."
