            "它和 intolerance 很容易混。lactose intolerance 是乳糖不耐受，通常是消化酶问题，不等于 milk allergy。allergy 更强调免疫反应。",
            "语法上常说 have an allergy to something 或 be allergic to something。allergic 是形容词，allergy 是名词。"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "一语道破",
          "lines": [
            "\"An allergy is the immune system overreacting to the wrong target. Allergy 是免疫系统把不该攻击的东西当成敌人。\""
          ]
        }
      ],
