        {
          "title": "深层解释",
          "lines": [
            "Ease 的核心是没有阻力。with ease 是轻松地；put someone at ease 是让人放松；ease pain 是减轻疼痛；ease restrictions 是放宽限制。",
            "它比 alleviate 更口语、适用范围更广。你可以 ease a door open，也可以 ease someone's fears，还可以 ease into a new routine。",
