        },
        {
          "title": "用法边界",
          "lines": [
            "典型搭配: the suffix -ship；craftsmanship；friendship；leadership",
            "近义词区别: -ship 是后缀表状态/身份；-hood 也表状态（childhood）；-ment 表结果。",
