      "definition": "传统的；传承的",
      "fileName": "3871-traditional.md",
      "lookupKey": "traditional",
      "partOfSpeech": "",
      "pronunciations": [
        "/trəˈdɪʃənl/"
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "当前语境",
          "lines": [
            "折叠摘要：traditional craftsmanship 中 traditional 修饰工匠精神。",
            "展开解析：traditional craftsmanship 中 traditional 修饰工匠精神，强调\"代代相传的、非现代的\"手艺，与 modern mass production 对照。",
            "**考研英语一 2011 Text 1 补充**：The widespread availability of such recordings has thus brought about a crisis in the institution of the traditional classical concert."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "词源与构词",
          "lines": [
            "词源/构词: tradition (传统) + -al；tradition 来自拉丁语 *traditio*（交付、传承），词根 *trans-* (over) + *dare* (give)。",
            "原始画面: 上一代把手里的东西交到下一代手里。",
            "核心意象: 交付传承(trad) = 传统的"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "用法边界",
          "lines": [
            "典型搭配: traditional culture；traditional values；traditional crafts",
            "近义词区别: traditional 指传统/传承的；conventional 指约定俗成（常偏守旧）；classical 指经典的。",
            "常见误用: traditional 褒义为主；说\"因循守旧\"用 conventional 更准。"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "深层解释",
          "lines": [
            "Traditional 的\"交付传承\"本义点出匠心的代际传递——它不是发明，而是接过。这正是对抗\"新潮快产\"的立场。"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "一语道破",
          "lines": [
            "\"Traditional is what the past trusted to the future. 传统，是过去托付给未来的东西。\""
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "note": "考研英语一 2011 Text 1"
      },
      "word": "Traditional"
    },
