        {
          "title": "用法边界",
          "lines": [
            "典型搭配: greater comfort；a great deal；great importance",
            "近义词区别: great 通用\"大/伟大\"；large 强调尺寸；big 口语化。",
            "常见误用: greater 是 great 比较级，表\"更……\"；\"更舒适\"是 greater comfort 而非 more great。"
