            "展开解析：文中：\"The widespread increase in durable goods ownership directly mirrors...\"",
            "新语境（考研英语一 2010 Text 3）：widespread 在考研写作中替换 common、prevalent，强调'范围广、影响大'。展开解析：the widespread propagation of influence through networks widespread 在考研写作中替换 common、prevalent，强调'范围广、影响大'。本文用 widespread propagation 描述全球级联的空间覆盖。 来源：考研英语一 2010 Text 3。",
            "**考研英语一 2011 Text 1 补充**：The widespread availability of such recordings has thus brought about a crisis in the institution of the traditional classical concert."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "词源与构词",
          "lines": [
            "词源/构词: 复合词：wide(广) + spread(扩散)。",
            "原始画面: 影响铺满一大片区域。",
            "核心意象: 广 + 铺开 = widespread。"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "用法边界",
          "lines": [
            "典型搭配: widespread increase；widespread use；widespread concern",
            "近义词区别: widespread 强调分布广；common 强调常见；prevalent 强调流行 prevalent。",
            "常见误用: widespread 作定语（a widespread increase）；不可说 very much widespread（用 highly）。"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "深层解释",
          "lines": [
            "the widespread increase 概括三类家电整体普及上行，与后文 specific surge（空调）形成\"面—点\"结构。"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "一语道破",
          "lines": [
            "\"Widespread is spread so far it covers the field. 广泛，是铺得够远而盖住全场。\""
          ]
        }
