            "\"Workplace\" comes from Old English \"weorc\" (work) + \"place\" (place). In the essay, it is used in the context of prepare for interviews by learning about Chinese workplace culture. The word carries the idea of the physical or cultural environment where work happens. Learners should pay attention to its collocations such as workplace culture. workplace is one word; it refers to the environment, not just the building. A common mistake is do not say \"work place\" as two words when used as a noun."
          ]
