          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "一语道破",
          "lines": [
            "\"Circulation turns storage into service — books that move teach more than books that sit. 流通让储存变成服务——流动的书比静止的书教得更多。\""
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "2016 Text 4 补充语境",
          "lines": [
