          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "一语道破",
          "lines": [
            "\"Depend is where the weight hangs — results do not float; they hang on what you actually do. 取决是重量悬挂的地方——结果不会漂浮，它们挂在你真正做的事上。\""
          ]
        }
