            "展开解析：The supposed importance of influentials derives from a plausible-sounding but largely untested theory called the 'two-step flow of communication'. plausible-sounding 是合成形容词（plausible + sounding），作者用它修饰理论，意在'先承认有道理、后质疑未经检验'。这一搭配与第 32 题答案（D：requires solid evidence）直接呼应。 来源：考研英语一 2010 Text 3。"
