            "展开解析：some researchers have come up with the finding that influentials have far less impact on social epidemics than is generally supposed. come up with 后接 finding / idea / solution / plan，是考研写作和阅读中提出观点的核心搭配。它强调'主动想出'，与 find（偶然发现）的隐含主体差异值得在写作中利用。 来源：考研英语一 2010 Text 3。"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "词源与构词",
          "lines": [
