          "title": "一语道破",
          "lines": [
            "\"Coming up with an idea is half inspiration, half retrieval. 想出一个点子，一半靠灵感，一半靠检索。\""
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "note": "考研英语一 2010 Text 3"
