        },
        {
          "title": "深层解释",
          "lines": [
            "考研写作中 principal / main / primary / chief 的选择体现精确度。掌握四者差异是高阶写作的关键。"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "一语道破",
          "lines": [
            "\"Principal is to importance as cardinal is to direction. principal 对应重要性，正如 cardinal 对应方向。\""
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "note": "考研英语一 2010 Text 3"
