        },
        {
          "title": "一语道破",
          "lines": [
            "\"Enormous is not just big; it is big enough to demand attention. Enormous 不只是大，而是大到无法忽视。\""
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "note": "考研英语一 2010 Text 4"
      }
