          "title": "当前语境",
          "lines": [
            "**折叠摘要**：flexibility 指 FASB 修改规则后，银行在确认长期资产损失方面获得的更大回旋空间。",
            "**展开解析**：These gave banks more freedom to use models to value illiquid assets and more flexibility in recognizing losses on long-term assets in their income statements. 作者列举银行获得的两大好处：评估资产的 freedom 和确认损失的 flexibility。 来源：考研英语一 2010 Text 4。"
          ]
