          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "一语道破",
          "lines": [
            "\"To download is to untie presence from place. 下载，就是把「在场」从地点上解绑。\""
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "note": "考研英语一 2011 Text 1"
      }
