          "title": "当前语境",
          "lines": [
            "考研英语一 2012 Text 1：Tina Rosenberg contends that peer pressure can also be a positive force through what she calls the social cure."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "词源与构词",
          "lines": [
            "- **词源/构词**: 源自拉丁语 contendere，con-（共同）+ tendere（拉伸、努力）。",
