            "The paradox of choice：选择越多，满足越少。"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "一语道破",
          "lines": [
            "\"A paradox is two truths that refuse to cancel each other. 悖论，是两个不愿互相抵消的真相。\""
          ]
        }
