          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "一语道破",
          "lines": [
            "\"Wholly means there is no part left over. 完全地，是没有剩下任何部分。\""
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "note": "考研英语一 2013 Text 2"
      }
    },
