          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "一语道破",
          "lines": [
            "\"A selling point is the feature that makes someone reach for their wallet. 卖点，是让人伸手掏钱包的特点。\""
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "note": "考研英语一 2013 Text 2"
      }
