          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "一语道破",
          "lines": [
            "\"Appreciation is not always gratitude; sometimes it is simply finally seeing what was there. 认识不总是感激，有时只是终于看见原本就在那的东西。\""
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "note": "考研英语一 2013 Text 3"
      }
