          "lines": [
            "- **典型搭配**: perhaps willfully; willfully ignore; willfully blind",
            "- **近义词区别**: willfully 含“明知故犯/执意”意味，deliberately 中性更强。",
            "- **常见误用**: 美式 willfully / 英式 wilfully 均可。"
          ]
