          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "一语道破",
          "lines": [
            "\"Dazzlingly complicated is so bright with detail that you go blind to the shape. 复杂得令人目眩，是细节亮到让你看不见轮廓。\""
          ]
        }
      ],
