          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "一语道破",
          "lines": [
            "\"To await trial is to stand in the shadow of a verdict not yet spoken. 候审，是站在尚未宣读的判决的阴影里。\""
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "note": "考研英语一 2015 Text 4"
      }
