          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "用法边界",
          "lines": [
            "- **典型搭配**: rule out the possibility; rule out a cause; cannot be ruled out",
            "- **近义词区别**: rule out 是主动排除，exclude 更正式，也可指排除在外。",
